        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "# Prepaid Airtime Investigation",
          "This optional notebook accompanies the telecommunications workshop's activation-fraud graph lab. It preserves the PGX algorithm exercises using transferable prepaid voice minutes. It is not the SQL/PGQ activation-fraud graph.",
          "Prerequisites: a PGQL property graph named AIRTIME_GRAPH over PREPAID_ACCOUNTS and AIRTIME_TRANSFERS, the TRANSFERS edge label, the ACCOUNT_ID vertex property, and access to the in-memory PGX server. The SQL loader supplies the tables; the optional PGQL setup block in the stack runbook creates the graph before this notebook can run.",
          "Accounts 534, 597, 934, 387, and 406 are sample dataset IDs. Outputs have been cleared. Run every paragraph in sequence to produce results; rankings, paths, and counts depend on the loaded graph."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
